msgid "奉加PB系列"
msgstr "Phyplus PB Series"

#: ../source/docs/development-environment/BT/pb.rst:5
#: dc0394bfbf5a4e658469ea1a356dae3b
msgid "1. 简介"
msgstr "1. Introduction"

#: ../source/docs/development-environment/BT/pb.rst:6
#: d40fa2835a8749d2a2549ea969607a91
msgid ""
"安信可科技针对物联网设计通用型的蓝牙模组，其功能强大、用途广泛。可以用于智能灯、智能插座、智能空调等其他智能家电。同时符合BLE 5.0及SIG "
"Mesh规范，可直接通过智能手机组建Mesh网络，也可对接天猫精灵等智能音箱，适用于多种智能家居应用场景。"
msgstr ""
"Ai-Thinker Technology has designed a general-purpose Bluetooth module for"
" IoT applications. It is powerful and widely applicable, and can be used "
"in smart lights, smart sockets, smart air conditioners, and other smart "
"home appliances. It also complies with BLE 5.0 and SIG Mesh "
"specifications. A Mesh network can be created directly via a smartphone, "
"and it can also be connected to smart speakers such as Tmall Genie, "
"making it suitable for various smart home application scenarios."

#: ../source/docs/development-environment/BT/pb.rst:8
#: e223434c63b9446cb781658e65175551
msgid "1.1mm 间距 SMD-20 封装；6 路 PWM 输出；"
msgstr "1.1mm pitch SMD-20 package; 6-channel PWM output;"

#: 7ac6ba4583c9477d95fabdab7e388fcd
#: ../source/docs/development-environment/BT/pb.rst:9
msgid "采用BLE 5.0 协议，支Sig Mesh，支持天猫精灵/APP语音控制。"
msgstr ""
"Uses the BLE 5.0 protocol, supports SIG Mesh, and supports Tmall Genie / "
"APP voice control;"

#: 8c4f19cbbdb14102bd8945f6558fbbff
#: ../source/docs/development-environment/BT/pb.rst:10
msgid "支持半孔焊盘和天线孔和板载天线。半孔焊盘可把天线引导主板上，天线孔可在模组上直接焊接弹簧天线；"
msgstr ""
"Supports castellated pads, antenna holes, and an onboard antenna. The "
"castellated pads can route the antenna to the mainboard, while the "
"antenna hole allows a spring antenna to be soldered directly onto the "
"module;"

#: ../source/docs/development-environment/BT/pb.rst:11
#: db441c40f39b436a87b0a81e1d844e08
#, python-format
msgid "亮度（占空比）调整范围 5%-100%，PWM 输出频率 1KHz；"
msgstr ""
"Brightness (duty cycle) adjustment range: 5%-100%, PWM output frequency: "
"1kHz;"

#: ../source/docs/development-environment/BT/pb.rst:12
#: c5b523e54daf4f4392fcf9b3125d144e
msgid "支持ESP32-G蓝牙网关通讯，实现远程随时随地控制；"
msgstr ""
"Supports communication with the ESP32-G Bluetooth gateway, enabling "
"remote control anytime and anywhere;"

#: 009acc7ae7b9446da77c80c534f37f24
#: ../source/docs/development-environment/BT/pb.rst:13
msgid "支持windows环境SDK二次开发，资料代码全部开源，支持AT指令接入天猫精灵；"
msgstr ""
"Supports secondary development with the SDK in a Windows environment. All"
" documentation and code are open source. Supports AT command access to "
"Tmall Genie;"

#: ../source/docs/development-environment/BT/pb.rst:14
#: de513230691f490fa630ea53ba60b78b
msgid "支持Android/IOS APP和微信小程序控制；"
msgstr "Supports Android/iOS apps and WeChat Mini Program control;"

#: 5057d694bcb14555b1e2c498e30885f0
#: ../source/docs/development-environment/BT/pb.rst:16
msgid "更多资料请转跳： `安信可官方docs <https://docs.ai-thinker.com/blue_tooth_pb>`__"
msgstr ""
"For more information, please visit: `Ai-Thinker official docs "
"<https://docs.ai-thinker.com/blue_tooth_pb>`__"

#: ../source/docs/development-environment/BT/pb.rst:19
#: cbf1d531051c44bcabb3423813873032
msgid "2. 开发环境搭建"
msgstr "2. Setting Up the Development Environment"

#: ../source/docs/development-environment/BT/pb.rst:22
#: dec0beca58ba43028310e709e35241f0
msgid "2.1 BLE基础知识"
msgstr "2.1 BLE Basics"

#: ../source/docs/development-environment/BT/pb.rst:23
#: ef4a5997c14742788ba01c642ed2ea48
msgid ""
"Ble 协议栈中的 GAP 层负责处理设备访问模式，包括设备发现、建立连接、终止连接、初始化安全管理和设备配置，所以在 ble "
"协议栈中有不少函数均是以 GAP 为前缀，这些函数会负责以上的内容。 GAP 层总是作为下面四个钟角色之一："
msgstr ""
"The GAP layer in the BLE protocol stack is responsible for handling "
"device access modes, including device discovery, connection "
"establishment, connection termination, security management "
"initialization, and device configuration. Therefore, many functions in "
"the BLE protocol stack are prefixed with GAP, and these functions are "
"responsible for the tasks mentioned above. The GAP layer always operates "
"as one of the following four roles:"

#: 32bf364853ca4c8987d8b8ce30866f1b
#: ../source/docs/development-environment/BT/pb.rst:26
msgid "Broadcaster 广播者——不可以连接的一直在广播的设备；"
msgstr ""
"Broadcaster — A device that continuously broadcasts and cannot be "
"connected;"

#: ../source/docs/development-environment/BT/pb.rst:27
#: aa07ec6fc2e74af7be9aa3eaa8b11964
msgid "Observer 观测者——可扫描广播设备，但不能发起建立连接的设备；"
msgstr ""
"Observer — A device that can scan broadcasting devices but cannot "
"initiate a connection;"

#: ../source/docs/development-environment/BT/pb.rst:28
#: d77a2de6f346466aa64a813b29d976d9
msgid "Peripheral 从机 ——可被连接的广播设备，可以在单个链路层连接中作从机。"
msgstr ""
"Peripheral — A connectable broadcasting device that can act as a slave in"
" a single link-layer connection;"

#: ../source/docs/development-environment/BT/pb.rst:29
#: ff1a31eb28de4ab4a6861e74939cfd56
msgid "Central 主机 ——可以扫描广播设备并发起连接，在单个链路层或多链路层中"
msgstr ""
"Central — A device that can scan broadcasting devices and initiate "
"connections, in a single link-layer or multi-link-layer connection"

#: ../source/docs/development-environment/BT/pb.rst:30
#: daa8a597e3314aa39734250ae2959b90
msgid "作为主机。"
msgstr "acts as a master."

#: 3fa4407a606c4d8c80a9a8772154261d
#: ../source/docs/development-environment/BT/pb.rst:31
msgid ""
"在典型的蓝牙低功耗系统中，从机设备广播特定的数据，以便让主机知道他是一个可以连接的设备，广播内容包括设备地址以及一些额外的数据，如设备名、服务等。主机收到广播数据后，会向从机发送扫描请求"
" ScanRequest，然后从机将特定的数据回应给主机，称为扫描回应 "
"ScanResponse。主机收到扫描回应后，便知道这是一个可以建立连接的外部设备，这就是设备发现的全过程。此时，主机可以向从机发起建立连接的请求，连接请求包括下面一些参数。"
msgstr ""
"In a typical Bluetooth Low Energy system, a peripheral device broadcasts "
"specific data so that the central device knows it is a connectable "
"device. The broadcast content includes the device address and some "
"additional data, such as the device name and services. After receiving "
"the broadcast data, the central device sends a ScanRequest to the "
"peripheral device. The peripheral device then responds with specific "
"data, called a ScanResponse. After receiving the scan response, the "
"central device knows that this is an external device that can establish a"
" connection. This is the complete device discovery process. At this "
"point, the central device can initiate a connection request to the "
"peripheral device. The connection request includes the following "
"parameters:"

#: ../source/docs/development-environment/BT/pb.rst:32
#: bed5320c9ce84b56a536e9d386c86f49
msgid ""
"连接间隔——在两个 BLE "
"设备的连接中使用调频机制，两个设备使用特定的信道收发数据，然后过一段时间后再使用新的信道。（链路层处理信道切换），两设备在信道切换后收发数据称之为连接事件，即使没有应用数据的收发，两个设备任然会通过交换链路层数据来维持连接，连接间隔就是两个连接事件之间的时间间隔，连接间隔以1.25ms"
" 为单位，连接间隔的值为 6（7.5ms）~3200（4s）。"
msgstr ""
"Connection interval — In a connection between two BLE devices, a "
"frequency-hopping mechanism is used. The two devices transmit and receive"
" data on a specific channel, then switch to a new channel after a period "
"of time. (Channel switching is handled by the link layer.) The data "
"transmission and reception after the channel switch is called a "
"connection event. Even when no application data is transmitted or "
"received, the two devices still exchange link-layer data to maintain the "
"connection. The connection interval is the time interval between two "
"connection events. It is measured in units of 1.25ms, with a value range "
"of 6 (7.5ms) to 3200 (4s)."

#: ../source/docs/development-environment/BT/pb.rst:33
#: f64f92f1f38b440a86ca211d704de3ce
msgid "从机延时——这个参数的设置可以使从机跳过若干连接事件，这给了从机更多的灵活度，如果它没有数据发送时，可以选择跳过连接时间继续休眠，以节省功耗。"
msgstr ""
"Slave latency — This parameter allows the slave device to skip several "
"connection events, giving the slave more flexibility. If it has no data "
"to send, it can skip the connection event and continue sleeping to reduce"
" power consumption."

#: 6559a2c448af4e80b3ae942ba0ffe695
#: ../source/docs/development-environment/BT/pb.rst:34
msgid "管理超时——这是两个成功连接事件之间的最大允许的间隔，如果超过了这个时间"
msgstr "Supervision timeout — This is the maximum allowed interval between two successful connection events. If this time is exceeded"

#: 446136093a30420780b801eefdfe7572
#: ../source/docs/development-environment/BT/pb.rst:36
msgid ""
"（这个值的单位是 10ms）而没有成功的连接事件，设备被认为丢失连接，返回到未 连接状态，管理超时的范围是 "
"100（100ms）~3200（32s）另外，超时值必须大于有效的连接间隔[有效的连接间隔=连接间隔*（1+从机延时）]。"
msgstr ""
"(the unit is 10 ms) without a successful connection event, the device is considered disconnected and returns to the disconnected state. "
"The supervision timeout range is 100 (100 ms) to 3200 (32 s). The timeout must be greater than the effective connection interval [effective interval = connection interval × (1 + slave latency)]."

#: 26cf8b3b01da4f30ae79896828de1170
#: ../source/docs/development-environment/BT/pb.rst:39
msgid ""
"安全管理——只有已认证的连接中，特定的数据数据才能被读写，一旦连接建立，两个设备进行配对，当配对完成后，形成加密连接的密钥，在典型的应用中，外设请求集中器提供密钥来完成配对工作。密钥是一个固定的值，如"
" "
"000000，也可以随机生成一个数据提供给使用者，当主机设备发送正确的密钥后，两设备交换安全密钥并加密认证链接。在许多情况下，同一对外设和主机会不时的连接和断开，ble"
" "
"的安全机制中有一项特性，允许两个设备之间建立长久的安全密钥信息，这种特性称为绑定，他允许两设备连接时快速的完成加密认证，而不需要每次连接时执行配对的完整过程。"
msgstr ""
"Security management — Specific data can be read or written only over an authenticated connection. After a connection is established, the devices pair and create an encryption key. "
"The key can be fixed, such as 000000, or generated randomly for the user. Bonding lets the same peripheral and central device reuse long-term security information, so later connections can authenticate without repeating the full pairing process."

