msgstr "3. Debugging and Flashing"

#: 15896886d2124c0d9fbb3f9975cdf832
#: ../source/docs/development-environment/BT/pb.rst:69
msgid "在MDK工具栏按钮，点击 Option for target 按钮 ，打开项目的 option 对话框。"
msgstr ""
"In the MDK toolbar, click the \"Option for target\" button to open the "
"project \"option\" dialog box."

#: 759563b25a4e44ad8cfbbcbb6a4969c7
#: ../source/docs/development-environment/BT/pb.rst:73
msgid "在 C/C++标签页的 Preprocessor SymbolsDefine 里面，开发者可以改变对应的预编译宏："
msgstr ""
"In the C/C++ tab, under \"Preprocessor Symbols -> Define\", developers "
"can change the corresponding precompiled macros:"

#: 7de8dd77afd54f469196841abf86fabc
#: ../source/docs/development-environment/BT/pb.rst:75
msgid ""
"CFG_SLEEP_MODE=PWR_MODE_SLEEP ：使能低功耗模式，固件程序执行过程中， "
"会在空闲过程进入睡眠，睡眠之后调试器无法进行调试跟踪，断点也失效。"
msgstr ""
"CFG_SLEEP_MODE=PWR_MODE_SLEEP: Enables low-power mode. During firmware "
"execution, the device enters sleep mode when idle. After entering sleep "
"mode, the debugger cannot perform debugging or tracing, and breakpoints "
"become invalid."

#: 123203fa0a044a18866fc8b0bdd51322
#: ../source/docs/development-environment/BT/pb.rst:76
msgid "CFG_SLEEP_MODE=PWR_MOD_ENO_SLEEP ：关闭低功耗模式，固件程序执行过 程中，处理器一直处于唤醒状态。"
msgstr ""
"CFG_SLEEP_MODE=PWR_MOD_ENO_SLEEP: Disables low-power mode. During "
"firmware execution, the processor remains awake."

#: 9514186d54534fd2b6a561cb4864d76d
#: ../source/docs/development-environment/BT/pb.rst:77
msgid "DEBUG_INFO=1：使能调试信息，默认通过串口输出：P9(Tx),P10(Rx)"
msgstr ""
"DEBUG_INFO=1: Enables debug information output. By default, debug "
"information is output through the serial port: P9 (Tx), P10 (Rx)."

#: ../source/docs/development-environment/BT/pb.rst:78
#: a43c6b24a78a484cba3e49f7d9770967
msgid "DEBUG_INFO=0：关闭调试信息"
msgstr "DEBUG_INFO=0: Disables debug information output."

